# SkyGuard-AI — Full Prototype Implementation Goals

## Purpose
Create a single, execution-ready plan that drives SkyGuard-AI from the current ~65 % completion level to a demonstrably “full prototype” for **Smart India Hackathon 2026, Problem Statement 073**. This document defines the target state, breaks work into themed workstreams, and lists measurable deliverables required for final acceptance.

